                "text": "<p>Mary, Queen of Scots was executed in 1587 because she kept getting involved in Catholic plots to kill Elizabeth and take the English throne. Walsingham’s spies caught her sending secret letters to plotters, so Elizabeth finally had to execute her to stay safe.</p>",
